Description: Build native desktop applications using 'R' and modern web-based
    user interfaces. Provides a robust 'R6'-based event loop, asynchronous
    background task management via 'mirai' and 'callr', and a native message
    bridge for seamless 'R'-to-user-interface communication without listening ports
    or network overhead.
